-});
-
-const tools = toolkit.getTools();
-// ... use tools ...
-
-await toolkit.close(); // Clean up when done
-```
-
-#### Tools
-
-The toolkit works with LangChain and Vercel's AI SDK and can be passed as a list of tools. For example:
-
-```typescript
